ot;discussion&quot;:{&quot;_id&quot;:&quot;67066414749993305db78dd9&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Start discussing this article&quot;,&quot;isPullRequest&quot;:false,&quot;events&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;688493c4a0b9456257efd27d&quot;,&quot;author&quot;:{&quot;_id&quot;:&quot;635c1953445de485328e372d&quot;,&quot;avatarUrl&quot;:&quot;/avatars/5c4b036f3e01bcafbf655792ed25beb4.svg&quot;,&quot;fullname&quot;:&quot;Minh Nguyen Tan&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Minhnt27&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;isPro&quot;:false,&quot;isHf&quot;:false,&quot;isHfAdmin&quot;:false,&quot;isMod&quot;:false,&quot;isUserFollowing&quot;:false},&quot;createdAt&quot;:&quot;2025-07-26T08:37:24.000Z&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;comment&quot;,&quot;data&quot;:{&quot;edited&quot;:false,&quot;hidden&quot;:false,&quot;latest&quot;:{&quot;raw&quot;:&quot;Hi, \nThank you for the interesting article. \n\nI have an issue in reproducing the experiments on Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct/Llama-3.2.1B-Instruct and Qwen-2.5-7B-Instruct/Qwen-2.5-0.5B-Instruct \n\nWhen reproducing the experiment with default setting on a A100 40GB GPU, I found the generation speed of Disco is slower than autoregressive decoding. \n\nDo you have any idea for this issue?\n\nThank you so much.&quot;,&quot;html&quot;:&quot;&lt;p>Hi,&lt;br>Thank you for the interesting article. &lt;/p>\n&lt;p>I have an issue in reproducing the experiments on Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct/Llama-3.2.1B-Instruct and Qwen-2.5-7B-Instruct/Qwen-2.5-0.5B-Instruct &lt;/p>\n&lt;p>When reproducing the experiment with default setting on a A100 40GB GPU, I found the generation speed of Disco is slower than autoregressive decoding. &lt;/p>\n&lt;p>Do you have any idea for this issue?&lt;/p>\n&lt;p>Thank you so much.&lt;/p>\n&quot;,&quot;updatedAt&quot;:&quot;2025-07-26T08:37:24.353Z&quot;,&quot;author&quot;:{&quot;_id&quot;:&quot;635c1953445de485328e372d&quot;,&quot;avatarUrl&quot;:&quot;/avatars/5c4b036f3e01bcafbf655792ed25beb4.svg&quot;,&quot;fullname&quot;:&quot;Minh Nguyen Tan&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Minhnt27&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;isPro&quot;:false,&quot;isHf&quot;:false,&quot;isHfAdmin&quot;:false,&quot;isMod&quot;:false,&quot;isUserFollowing&quot;:false}},&quot;numEdits&quot;:0,&quot;identifiedLanguage&quot;:{&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;probability&quot;:0.8101903200149536},&quot;editors&quot;:[&quot;Minhnt27&quot;],&quot;editorAvatarUrls&quot;:[&quot;/avatars/5c4b036f3e01bcafbf655792ed25beb4.svg&quot;],&quot;reactions&quot;:[],&quot;isReport&quot;:false}},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;688773a488c8e89cb07efc65&quot;,&quot;author&quot;:{&quot;_id&quot;:&quot;61d2c54d76c37de24cfed058&quot;,&quot;avatarUrl&quot;:&quot;https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/1641203017724-noauth.png&quot;,&quot;fullname&quot;:&quot;Joao Gante&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;joaogante&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;isPro&quot;:false,&quot;isHf&quot;:false,&quot;isHfAdmin&quot;:false,&quot;isMod&quot;:false,&quot;followerCount&quot;:228,&quot;isUserFollowing&quot;:false},&quot;createdAt&quot;:&quot;2025-07-28T12:57:08.000Z&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;comment&quot;,&quot;data&quot;:{&quot;edited&quot;:false,&quot;hidden&quot;:false,&quot;latest&quot;:{&quot;raw&quot;:&quot;Hi @Minhnt27 👋\n\nCan you share a minimal reproducer? It would help us massively to pin the exact issue you're seeing 🤗&quot;,&quot;html&quot;:&quot;&lt;p>Hi &lt;span class=\&quot;SVELTE_PARTIAL_HYDRATER contents\&quot; data-target=\&quot;UserMention\&quot; data-props=\&quot;{&amp;quot;user&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Minhnt27&amp;quot;}\&quot;>&lt;span class=\&quot;inline-block\&quot;>&lt;span class=\&quot;contents\&quot;>&lt;a href=\&quot;/Minhnt27\&quot;>@&lt;span class=\&quot;underline\&quot;>Minhnt27&lt;/span>&lt;/a>&lt;/span> &lt;/span>&lt;/span> 👋&lt;/p>\n&lt;p>Can you share a minimal reproducer? It would help us massively to pin the exact issue you're seeing 🤗&lt;/p>\n&quot;,&quot;updatedAt&quot;:&quot;2025-07-28T12:57:08.817Z&quot;,&quot;author&quot;:{&quot;_id&quot;:&quot;61d2c54d76c37de24cfed058&quot;,&quot;avatarUrl&quot;:&quot;https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/1641203017724-noauth.png&quot;,&quot;fullname&quot;:&quot;Joao Gante&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;joaogante&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;isPro&quot;:false,&quot;isHf&quot;:false,&quot;isHfAdmin&quot;:false,&quot;isMod&quot;:false,&quot;followerCount&quot;:228,&quot;isUserFollowing&quot;:false}},&quot;numEdits&quot;:0,&quot;identifiedLanguage&quot;:{&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;probability&quot;:0.943413257598877},&quot;editors&quot;:[&quot;joaogante&quot;],&quot;editorAvatarUrls&quot;:[&quot;https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/1641203017724-noauth.png&quot;],&quot;reactions&quot;:[],&quot;isReport&quot;:false}}],&quot;status&quot;:&quot;open&quot;,&quot;isReport&quot;:false,&quot;pinned&quot;:false,&quot;locked&quot;:false,&quot;collection&quot;:&quot;community_blogs&quot;},&quot;contextAuthors&quot;:[&quot;jmamou&quot;,&quot;orenpereg&quot;,&quot;joaogante&quot;,&quot;lewtun&quot;,&quot;danielkorat&quot;,&quot;Nadav-Timor&quot;,&quot;moshew&quot;],&quot;primaryEmailConfirmed&quot;:false,&quot;discussionRole&quot;:0,&quot;acceptLanguages&quot;:[&quot;*&quot;],&quot;withThread&quot;:true,&quot;cardDisplay&quot;:false,&quot;repoDiscussionsLocked&quot;:false}"><div class="relative -mx-2.5"><!--[-1--><!--]--> <!--[--><div class="relative"><!--[-1--><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <div class="relative pt-0 pb-3"><!--[0--><!--[-1--><!--]--> <dialog class="shadow-alternate z-40 mx-4 my-auto h-fit select-text overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-white max-sm:max-w-[calc(100dvw-2rem)] sm:mx-auto lg:mt-26 md:portrait:mt-30 xl:mt-30 2xl:mt-32 w-full lg:w-10/12 xl:w-8/12 2xl:w-7/12 max-w-[calc(100%-4rem)] lg:max-w-4xl  "><div tabindex="-1" class="outline-none focus:ring-0 focus-visible:ring-0"><!--[-1--><!--]--></div></dialog><!----> <div id="688493c4a0b